      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc/en/LCmc122_en.bi5_@00002b0b",
      "file_offset": 11019,
      "source": "$But it seems quite\nreal to me.",
      "source_sha256": "232dfe19591f96e63dd5f1a0eb1dbea5ece90ac3b88f2293897a315acb3ac7ff",
      "vi": "",
      "status": "todo",
      "source_review": "candidate",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc/en/LCmc122_en.bi5_@00002b30",
      "file_offset": 11056,
      "source": "To me as well.",
      "source_sha256": "ed0c5d1842d447d1cd2a1ba092c13b6c2fccfbfbea4c1b91114d28630cc20024",
      "vi": "",
      "status": "todo",
      "source_review": "candidate",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc/en/LCmc122_en.bi5_@00002b43",
      "file_offset": 11075,
      "source": ",But the afterworld\nis no such place.",
      "source_sha256": "c735172367b3d97baa97893418ae3d8dc7bbf3f50c0b9a6cda454bd413ce82e5",
      "vi": "",
      "status": "todo",
      "source_review": "candidate",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc/en/LCmc122_en.bi5_@00002b70",
      "file_offset": 11120,
      "source": "How do you know?",
      "source_sha256": "07fa34e2694cb6ca6879ec76be509677224b63ff761db3dea4b6767c35d6bda9",
      "vi": "",
      "status": "todo",
      "source_review": "candidate",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc/en/LCmc122_en.bi5_@00002b88",
      "file_offset": 11144,
      "source": "I just know.",
      "source_sha256": "abc2b4503251a8a9290546971f90dfbe103d80f281c1df95b8adfc29000376b8",
      "vi": "",
      "status": "todo",
      "source_review": "candidate",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc/en/LCmc122_en.bi5_@00002ba3",
      "file_offset": 11171,
      "source": ",Why not, I could\ndo with a new story.",
      "source_sha256": "19d7747c52fc3081c7d128a1f610ec58c0c5541582e95da6f4499753fb7d7c42",
      "vi": "",
      "status": "todo",
      "source_review": "candidate",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc/en/LCmc122_en.bi5_@00002bcf",
